# Core Rule: Read AGENTS.md First

Whenever you work on a feature or make changes in the codebase, you must first read:

1. **Root Guide**: `AGENTS.md` (architecture, data models, cross-layer flows, environment).
2. **Corresponding Layer Guide**:
   - `backend/AGENTS.md` (when working on backend)
   - `frontend/AGENTS.md` (when working on frontend)
   - `blockchain/AGENTS.md` (when working on blockchain)

Always consult these files before writing code to ensure alignment with existing conventions, endpoints, and architecture.
